Opt-in quiet-checkpoint folding for the GoW GS FINISH countdown.
Only resume entries 0x17A328/0x17A32C are wrapped. Preserve the final decrement,
GS polling and all non-quiet checkpoints in generated code; default stays off.
GOW_FINISH_COUNTDOWN=1 selects the candidate, 0 retains the reference.
Validation: 560 differential cases, full verify and hidden gameplay smoke pass.
Scene-matched combat A/B was rejected for drift; no FPS/audio gain is claimed.
Integration: fix-chore patch 68-ee-finish-countdown, regenerated on the PR 26 chain (same change, new context).

